course_info.trial_description:
Hello!
Here I would like you to take a look at what the trial session is for. It is chance to:
1) get to know each other; 
2) discuss your learning goals; 
3) discuss your learning preferences; 
4) ask more questions about the tutor's teaching style;
5) create a plan of action for future lessons;  
6) to build a good rapport between you and the tutor. 
Hope to see you at the trial lesson)))
